{"4054420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kiss And Cry：我的女友脑子有问题", "steam_appid": 4054420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >故事简介</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一个关于彼此相遇的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在父母眼中，确诊抑郁障碍的女儿就好像被打上了“不正常”的标签。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不知道该表演出什么样情绪的许可纯，回到学校，继续做一个游离在人群之外的旁观者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >恰逢此刻，这个最讨厌被注视的女孩，遇上一个最习惯被注视的女孩。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她们互相确认、试探、拉扯、挣扎——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从陌生人到朋友——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从朋友到&quot;彼此唯一&quot;——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >两个“脑子有问题”的女孩就这样慢慢的靠近……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >林雪如是那种一进门就能让房间气氛亮起来的女生，外向、轻快、幽默，从不回避与人建立连接，也不会用强势去掌控别人的节奏，反而总是以一种看似无害、实则强韧的方式深入人心。她就是那种你很难拒绝的人，因为她把“靠近别人”这件事，做得那么自然、那么轻盈、那么理直气壮。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054420/extras/cea0d51270eb091058fc04641567b48f.avif?t=1786690698\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054420/extras_big/cea0d51270eb091058fc04641567b48f.avif?t=1786690698 width=1560 height=824 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >许可纯洞察力强，却慧极必伤；她讨厌被注视，又渴望被看见；当她早已习惯推开一切时，有人闯进了她的世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054420/extras/f3b25de6ba9410622d8f192b0ddd60a6.avif?t=1786690698\" data-bi